## 🎯 MISSION

Build a **STRENGTH TRAINING PROGRAM** focused on **MAXIMUM STRENGTH** and **MUSCLE DENSITY** (NOT size/hypertrophy).

**Key Difference from Build Muscle:**
- **Build Muscle (Hypertrophy):** Moderate weight (60-85% 1RM), 8-12 reps, 60-90 sec rest → BIGGER muscles
- **Increase Strength:** Heavy weight (80-95% 1RM), 1-5 reps, 3-5 min rest → STRONGER, DENSER muscles

