## 🏋️ THE 5 MACHINES PROGRAM

### Machine Selection (Your Request)

1. **Squat Machine** (Leg Press OR Smith Machine Squat)
2. **Bench Press** (Barbell Bench Press OR Machine Chest Press)
3. **Abs Machine** (Cable Crunches OR Ab Crunch Machine)
4. **Back Machine** (Lat Pulldown OR Seated Row Machine)
5. **Shoulder Press** (Overhead Press Machine OR Smith Machine)

**Why these 5?**
- Compound movements (multiple joints, multiple muscles)
- Safe to load heavy on machines
- Easy to track progressive overload
- Cover entire body (legs, chest, core, back, shoulders)

