### 1. Auto-Calculate Next Workout Weights

```javascript
function calculateNextWeekWeight(exercise, currentWeek, currentWeight, completedAllReps) {
  // Week 5 = deload (go back to Week 3 weight)
  if (currentWeek === 4 && nextWeek === 5) {
    return week3Weight; // deload
  }
  
  // If user completed all 5×5, add weight
  if (completedAllReps) {
    const increment = exercise.includes('squat') ? 10 : 5;
    return currentWeight + increment;
  }
  
  // If user failed, repeat same weight
  return currentWeight;
}
